  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.ibb.co%252f87nk2p2%252fOne-Block.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong> <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/87nk2p2/One-Block.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1129\" height=\"126\"></strong></a></h2>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这是一张冒险地图，类似于 <strong>IJAMinecraft</strong> 的 <strong>OneBlock</strong> 地图。 </span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在这张地图上，你将出现在一个悬浮于虚空之上的单一方块中。 </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你将不断挖掘 <strong>幸运方块</strong>！祝你好运！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/5WyT6XT\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://ibb.co/5WyT6XT\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎来到 </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Lucky OneBlock！</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这张 Minecraft 地图将带你踏上一段激动人心的</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以 <em><strong>单一方块</strong></em> 即 <em><strong>幸运方块</strong></em> 为核心的挑战冒险。<br>准备好迎接充满<strong>惊喜</strong>、<strong>危险</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">和<strong>机遇</strong>的旅程，在探索这个独特而有限的世界时。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/QJBT2Bh/bloggif-6485015b3d30f.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"452\" height=\"254\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你的主要目标是充分利用这个特殊的方块。<br>每次你挖开幸运方块，都会触发各种随机事件，<br>从丰厚的奖励到棘手的陷阱和强大的敌人。好运将与你同在！！</span><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">别忘了，策略和适应能力是存活于这张地图的关键。<br>随着进度推进，你将能够组合从<br>幸运方块中获得的物品，打造出强力武器、实用工具和防护装备。<br>掌握幸运的艺术，释放你的真正潜力！！</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4YQSMmq/This-map-requiere-mod.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block</a><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a>&nbsp;</span> </span><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">1.16.5 - 1.20.2</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-lucky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-lucky-block</a>&nbsp;</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">1.20.6<br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">此版本需要安装此模组</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[Architectury API]</a></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/myluckyblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/myluckyblock</a></span> &nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">1.21 - 1.21.11</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><em>这是我第一张使用数据包制作的地图！</em></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>我将不断更新并优化体验，添加目标与成就！</em><br><em>希望您能给予支持并提供良好的反馈<br></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">单方块搭配不同方块，还有附加包！！！！！</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-summer-oneblock\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky_Summer_OneBlock</a></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-summer-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f1c40f\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ypcDxRm/Summer-lucky-block.gif\" width=\"285\" height=\"160\"></span></span></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><a style=\"color:#f0f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock-pink-lucky\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky_OneBlock-Pink</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f0f\"><a style=\"color:#f0f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-oneblock-pink-lucky\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/P4tZPcx/Untitled-1.gif\" width=\"293\" height=\"165\"></a><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#c2e0f4;text-align:center\">\n<h2><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><a style=\"color:#c2e0f4\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-triple-oneblock\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lucky Triple OneBlock </a></span></h2>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/lucky-triple-oneblock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QH34YLb.gif\" width=\"275\" height=\"155\"></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>我的 Discord：</em></strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/B9rysAEFGk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2021/06/Discord-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"427\" height=\"240\"></a></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252fel_this_boy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://images.seeklogo.com/logo-png/47/2/buy-me-a-coffee-logo-png_seeklogo-477198.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"66\" height=\"66\">如果您想帮助我！！您可以通过这种方式提供财务支持！<br><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>[点击此处]</strong></span></span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">享受 25% 折扣请点击此处</span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fthisboy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e786a9cc-b379-4f61-b906-ed81aeb57024.png\" width=\"1351\" height=\"224\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下是运行此地图所需的操作步骤：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">服务器要求：请确保您的服务器运行的是 Forge 或 Fabric 版本。<strong>幸运方块</strong> 模组必须与客户端<strong>版本完全一致</strong>，这<strong>至关重要</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">幸运方块模组：您必须在<strong>mods 文件夹</strong>中放置幸运方块模组。否则您将不断掉出世界。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">操作步骤：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">1- 下载世界：确保已下载 Lucky OneBlock 世界文件，并将其放入<strong>saves 文件夹</strong>中。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">2- 下载幸运方块模组：下载幸运方块模组并将其放入<strong>mods 文件夹</strong>，然后通过<strong><em>F</em>abric 或 Forge</strong>加载。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:10px\">遇到问题？去 YouTube 搜索！一切都有解答！</span><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">游戏实况：</span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>感谢！！@skipthetutorial</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RixDjnfIrhE\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br></span></strong></span></p>",
